[[0,1379435,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-31T03:09:59","madazzahattereboot","",[],"<p>As they was inspecting the damage the Arkansan says to the tourist, &quot;This really done shook me up. I am going to have to take a pull on the jug.&quot; </p>\n<p>He reaches behind his seat and pulls out a jug of home brew. </p>\n<p>He offers it to the tourist, who takes a long pull and then hands it back to the local. who promptly put it back into the truck. </p>\n<p>The tourist said, &quot;Aren't you going to drink any?&quot; </p>\n<p>The local said, &quot;Naw. Leastwise, not until after the trooper gets here.&quot;</p>","A tourist and a local come to an intersection at the same time in the back hills of Arkansas and hit each other...","","repostedjokes"]]
