[[0,1379443,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-31T03:15:47","madazzahattereboot","",[],"<p>A man pulled up in his car, got out, saw the snail, and kicked it to kingdom come. </p>\n<p>Ten years later, the man is in his house and hears a knock at the door. </p>\n<p>He opens the door, but no one is there. </p>\n<p>Looking down, he sees a snail. </p>\n<p>The snail looks up at him and says &quot;So what was THAT all about?&quot;</p>","A snail was walking across a driveway...","","repostedjokes"]]
[[0,1379444,0,8,1,7,"2016-10-31T03:16:26","DietCokehead1","",[],"","Festival Fats","https://sli.mg/a/2SZHcS","fatpeoplehate"],[1,6693980,0,6,0,6,"2016-10-31T03:28:35","Carsandsarcasm","",[],"<p>Lots of pumpkin shapes there ... and delicious vegetables. </p>"],[2,6694008,6693980,4,0,4,"2016-10-31T03:33:43","BaronVonThunderBolt","",[],"<p>And a puppy!</p>"],[1,6694163,0,3,0,3,"2016-10-31T04:06:41","Runway22L","",[],"<p>How does someone that fat get any enjoyment out of life? Always having to sit and rest or their constant search for their next YUMBO. Give up already and give those kids a chance!</p>"],[1,6694901,0,2,0,2,"2016-10-31T07:19:05","FupaFister","",[],"<p>That look of disgust on the little girls face!</p>"],[1,6696374,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-31T14:34:49","GuyLeDouche","",[],"<p>Absolutely guarantee that'a the most exercise it's gotten in a while. It probably went home and celebrated with a pie.</p>"],[1,6702235,0,2,0,2,"2016-11-01T12:30:58","popejus","",[],"<p>I guess the stroller is where they keep their food?</p>"]]
