[[0,1379449,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-31T03:18:30","madazzahattereboot","",[],"<p>&quot;Doctor, I have this problem that I am always passing gas. At least it doesn't smell bad, but it does sometimes make a little noise, and it's affecting my social life.&quot; </p>\n<p>The doctor gives him some pills, and asks him to return the following week. </p>\n<p>The man returns a week later and says, &quot;Those pills didn't help at all. In fact, they made things worse. I still pass gas as much as I ever did, but now it smells something terrible.&quot; </p>\n<p>To which the doctor replies, &quot;Good, good. Okay, now that we have your nose working again, let's do something about that gas.&quot;</p>","A fellow goes to the doctor and says...","","repostedjokes"]]